#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/morpheus-ctl.rst:4
msgid ""
"``morpheus-ctl`` is useful beyond reconfigures and starting the ui, and "
"many commands can be run across all services, or scoped to a singe "
"service."
msgstr ""
"``morpheus-ctl`` is useful beyond reconfigures y starting the ui, y many "
"commands puede ser run across all services, o scoped to a singe service."

